{"parse":{"title":"A Lady's Code of Conduct","pageid":467730,"revid":2172361,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">A Lady&#39;s Code of Conduct</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b5/Talent_A_Lady%27s_Code_of_Conduct.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122055\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent A Lady&#39;s Code of Conduct\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b5/Talent_A_Lady%27s_Code_of_Conduct.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122055\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b5/Talent_A_Lady%27s_Code_of_Conduct.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122055 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b5/Talent_A_Lady%27s_Code_of_Conduct.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122055 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent A Lady&#39;s Code of Conduct\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_A_Lady%27s_Code_of_Conduct.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent A Lady&#39;s Code of Conduct.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sandrone\" title=\"Sandrone\">Sandrone</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/4th_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"4th Ascension Passive\">4th Ascension Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Talent\" title=\"Ascension Talent\">Ascension</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Increases Sandrone's <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a> based on her <a href=\"/wiki/ATK\" title=\"ATK\">ATK</a>. Every 100 ATK will increase her Elemental Mastery by 8. The maximum increase she can gain this way is 160.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/ATK\" title=\"ATK\">ATK</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>A Lady's Code of Conduct</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Sandrone\" title=\"Sandrone\">Sandrone</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/4th_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"4th Ascension Passive\">4th Ascension Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FA_Lady%2527s_Code_of_Conduct%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>A Lady's Code of Conduct</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">淑女的行事准则</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Shūnǚ de Xíngshì Zhǔnzé</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">A Lady's Code of Conduct</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">淑女的行事準則</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Shūnǚ de Xíngshì Zhǔnzé</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">淑女の礼儀作法</span><br /><small><i>Shukujo no Reigisahou</i></small></td><td>A Lady's Etiquette</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">숙녀의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">에티켓</span><br /><small><i>Sungnyeo-ui Etiket</i><